	(text "PGFB, EN/UV tied to IN; PG floats (unused).\nR3: 125 mA*kohm / 1k = ~125 mA limit.\nOUTS Kelvin to C4 (10V X7R, ESR < 50 mohm).\nR5 = 10 uA min load below 1 V.\nTie C3 and C4 grounds together; R3 to GND pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 76.2 0)
